          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Hot Water System Repairs",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Hot water system acting up? Our skilled technicians can diagnose and repair any issue, from faulty thermostats to leaking tanks. We work with all major brands to ensure your system is back up and running in no time. Facing hot water problems? Our prompt repair services will restore your hot water supply quickly and efficiently.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HJVrfn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Hot Water System Installation",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Need a new hot water system? We offer professional installation services for gas, electric, and solar hot water systems. Our experts will help you choose the right system for your home and ensure it’s installed correctly. Confused about which hot water system to choose? Our knowledgeable team will guide you through the selection process and handle the installation.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4TUAXj": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Hot Water System Maintenance",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Regular maintenance is key to keeping your hot water system running smoothly. Our maintenance services include checking for leaks, testing the thermostat, and flushing the tank to remove sediment buildup. Want to avoid unexpected breakdowns? Schedule regular maintenance with us to keep your hot water system in top condition.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ghqiH7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Gas Hot Water Systems",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Gas hot water systems are efficient and cost-effective. We offer installation, repair, and maintenance services for all types of gas hot water systems, ensuring you have a reliable supply of hot water. Looking for a reliable gas hot water solution? Our experts provide comprehensive services to keep your gas hot water system running efficiently. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UYX3ni": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Electric Hot Water Systems",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Electric hot water systems are a popular choice for many homes. We provide expert installation, repair, and maintenance services for electric hot water systems, ensuring you have hot water when you need it. Need a dependable electric hot water system? Our team will ensure your system is installed and maintained for optimal performance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WFRKQp": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Solar Hot Water Systems",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Reduce your energy bills with a solar hot water system. Our specialists offer installation, repair, and maintenance services for solar hot water systems, helping you harness the power of the sun. Want to save on energy costs? Our solar hot water services provide an eco-friendly solution for your home.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PHM88d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Emergency Hot Water Services",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Hot water emergencies can happen at any time. Our team is available 24/7 to provide emergency hot water repairs and replacements, ensuring you’re never left without hot water. Dealing with a hot water emergency? Contact us immediately for fast, reliable service.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
